{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Mankato ( ) is a city in Blue Earth, Nicollet, and Le Sueur counties in the state of Minnesota.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is the 22nd biggest city in Minnesota.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The population was 41,044 according to 2015 US census estimates, making it the fifth largest city in Minnesota outside of the Minneapolis–Saint Paul metropolitan area.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The county seat of Blue Earth County, it is located along a large bend of the Minnesota River at its confluence with the Blue Earth River.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" Mankato is across the Minnesota River from North Mankato.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" Mankato and North Mankato have a combined population of over 53,000, according to the 2010 census.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":6,"text":" It completely encompasses the town of Skyline.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":7,"text":" North of Mankato Regional Airport, a tiny non-contiguous part of the city is located within Le Sueur County.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":8,"text":" Most of the city of Mankato is located within Blue Earth County.","title":"Mankato, Minnesota"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Russian presidential aircraft are aircraft of the Russian presidential fleet used by the President of Russia and other government officials, the presidential fleet is operated by Rossiya Airlines.","title":"Russian presidential aircraft"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" As Russia is the largest country on Earth by land area, distances within Russia can be very long, and air travel is frequently needed for the President to travel across the country as well as internationally.","title":"Russian presidential aircraft"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Grand Maket Rossiya is a private museum in Saint Petersburg, Russia.","title":"Grand Maket Rossiya"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is a model layout designed on a scale of 1:87 and covers an area of .","title":"Grand Maket Rossiya"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" In this area, collective images of regions of the Russian Federation are represented.","title":"Grand Maket Rossiya"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" It is the largest model layout in Russia and the second largest in the world (after the Miniatur Wunderland in Hamburg, Germany).","title":"Grand Maket Rossiya"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The model is located in a two story building built in 1953, in the style of Stalin's empire.","title":"Grand Maket Rossiya"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" The creator of the project is a Saint Petersburg businessman Sergey Morozov.","title":"Grand Maket Rossiya"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Rossiya Airlines OJSC (Russian: АО «Авиакомпания „Россия“» , "AO Aviakompaniya "Rossiya""), sometimes branded as "Rossiya - Russian Airlines" (Russian: «Россия — Российские авиалинии» , "Rossiya — Rossiyskie avialinii"), is a Russian airline headquartered in Saint Petersburg with its hub at Pulkovo Airport.","title":"Rossiya Airlines"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is based in Saint Petersburg, there are branches in Moscow Vnukovo International Airport, Rostov-on-Don Airport and Orenburg Tsentralny Airport.","title":"Rossiya Airlines"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Rossiya is a fully owned subsidiary of Aeroflot.","title":"Rossiya Airlines"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Air Wisconsin Airlines is a regional airline based at Appleton International Airport in the town of Greenville, Wisconsin, United States, near Appleton.","title":"Air Wisconsin"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Air Wisconsin is the largest privately held regional airline in the United States.","title":"Air Wisconsin"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" It currently operates regional jet flights as American Eagle under contract to American Airlines via a code sharing agreement, serving cities in the U.S. and Canada with hubs at Boston Logan International Airport (BOS), Charlotte Douglas International Airport (CLT), Philadelphia International Airport (PHL) and Ronald Reagan Washington National Airport (DCA) .","title":"Air Wisconsin"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Air Wisconsin previously operated United Express service on behalf of United Airlines followed by US Airways Express service on behalf of US Airways prior to becoming an American Eagle regional air carrier.","title":"Air Wisconsin"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The company has announced it will once again partner with United Airlines as a United Express code sharing air carrier with primary hubs to be located at Chicago O'Hare International Airport (ORD) and Washington Dulles International Airport (IAD) beginning in September 2017 and will be "exclusively operating" as United Express by March 2018.","title":"Air Wisconsin"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Rossiya Theatre (Russian: Театр «Россия» ), formerly known as the Pushkinsky Cinema (Russian: Кинотеатр «Пушкинский» ) is monument of architecture and currently the largest theatre in Moscow operated by Stage Entertainment.","title":"Rossiya Theatre"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is located in Pushkinskaya Square.","title":"Rossiya Theatre"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: country
